            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#There are tons of online options for streaming and content. If you have Wi-Fi, the world is your oyster! You can always buy a Roku to stream live TV with no subscription costs, or connect a laptop to your television and go to Locast’s website to stream local TV channels for free.<ref>https://www.groundedreason.com/watch-local-channels-without-cable/</ref> You also have a ton of subscription options, including the obvious choices like Netflix and Hulu, if you want to watch content without cable or an antenna.<ref>https://ispfamily.com/how-to-get-tv-reception-without-cable-or-an-antenna/</ref>[[Image:Use Your Home Wiring as a TV or Radio Antenna Step 8.jpg|center]]"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#There are tons of online options for streaming and content. If you have Wi-Fi, the world is your oyster! You can always buy a Roku to stream live TV with no subscription costs, or connect a laptop to your television and go to Locast’s website to stream local TV channels for free.<ref>https://www.groundedreason.com/watch-local-channels-without-cable/</ref> You also have a ton of subscription options, including the obvious choices like Netflix and Hulu, if you want to watch content without cable or an antenna.<ref>https://ispfamily.com/how-to-get-tv-reception-without-cable-or-an-antenna/</ref><ref>https://swipeonidea.com/how-to-get-local-channels-on-samsung-smart-tv-without-antenna/</ref>[[Image:Use Your Home Wiring as a TV or Radio Antenna Step 8.jpg|center]]"
                ]
            }
